<Layout title="Publisher Removal · Foresight Labs"><section class="page-intro container"><p class="eyebrow">AURA publisher requests</p><h1>Need a feed<br /><em>removed?</em></h1><p>Rights holders can ask for feed removal or an attribution correction by email.</p></section><section class="section"><div class="container content"><h2>What to include</h2><ul><li>Your name and role at the publication</li><li>The RSS or Atom feed URL</li><li>The requested removal or correction</li><li>Any relevant article links or context</li></ul><p><a class="button button-dark" href="mailto:thisisaritrasaha@gmail.com?subject=AURA%20Publisher%20Removal%20Request">Email the publisher desk ↗</a></p><p>We will review requests in good faith. Publisher content remains owned by its respective rights holders; AURA does not claim ownership of it.</p></div></section></Layout>
